{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新しようと思ってたんだけど、携帯片手に記事書いては寝ちゃって…また記事書いては寝ちゃって…（泣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイペースなもんで5日も更新があいてしまいました(；；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんね、許してね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/weep.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"11日の東京モーターショーには、たくさんの方が来てくれて本当に嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中4時間も並んでくださった方もいて、本当に本当にありがとうございます(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は予選6位を通過したので、前半のイベントに参加することができました(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自己紹介で東京モーターショーにちなんでフラフープをしながら車のメーカーの名前を言おうと思っていたんですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まさかのフラフープが用意されてなくてできなかったぁ（泣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あああああ(；∀；)\n本当に申し訳なかったです。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グランツーリスモでは負けちゃったけど、楽しくできたから良かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもやっぱりカーブのところはどうしてもぶつかってしまうなぁ…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また機会があったら是非ともやりたいと思います(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会ではまいやん黄色を引いたので黄色チームで握手をさせて頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残念ながら今回握手できなかった方、また次のイベントで絶対握手しましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週またイベントあるから、またたくさんの方が来てくれるのを祈ってるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は握手会が本当に好きで、いつも握手会の時になると声も大きくなるし楽しくてにんまりしてます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんとたくさんお話できる機会だし、もっと私のことを知って貰って、もっともっと皆さんのことも知っていきたいです。♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日握手会やってもいいくらい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのくらい私は握手会が大好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ、題名何だかわかりました？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『どうすればいいですか？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の口癖みたいですね(>_<)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お化け屋敷ではリタイアしてお恥ずかしい姿を見せてしまった。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや！\nでも富士急の戦慄迷宮は一人じゃ行けないって〜〜〜〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行くとしたら大人数で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を誰かの後ろに着かせて手を引っ張って行ってほしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃなきゃ号泣するよ〜〜〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/crying.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして来週の番組は、料理に挑戦！\n私も作りました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来映えは…来週まで待っててね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日はせいらりんと遊んできたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくはせいらりんblogを見てください(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、これからお仕事行ってきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の七変化はおやすみです。\nもうちょっと待ってて(>_<)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/13/dvc00584.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}